{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0a01e1e69b2c8f3966b51f839965420d6f35e4188108cc492ddc8ec26f6dceec",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83bd651f3de0647f2cabf6ee3c6b58d46f5e0839795cf55d37e3693bd690ffb7",
      "text": "一直在寻找的东西",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85aa5703cddbe2dd41142caf9ec9e97098dc8aa2fa5fd71324b95499e47f0d3c",
      "text": "翔真在观看偶像的演唱会后重燃了往昔的热情，\n并在此契机下收到了星探的邀请。\n桐生接收到了来自宇宙的电波，决定创作以偶像\n为主题的落语。想要挑战新事物的\n九郎也同样被发掘了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83bd651f3de0647f2cabf6ee3c6b58d46f5e0839795cf55d37e3693bd690ffb7",
      "text": "一直在寻找的东西",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000013:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d65c8efddfbf0f9bbd504ba1c0f70629e362f8bf9a11d14242f989812c2346b",
      "text": "电视台·走廊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8162099ff47b553ee48f283a7b988615ff072b8217698ec5a0315c4eeab2169",
      "text": "今天也辛苦啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2327c32b16507ead4e1d8d7ca1d21b35eaf7f678500426fcc477afe1db1cd43a",
      "text": "翔真先生，辛苦了！\n您的谈话太精彩了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f48ad7417913964dcb295cd53e09e718cd47acd1454c81c3b7b18feaefed3ed0",
      "text": "哎呀，谢谢。\n多亏了大家的照应配合呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13d8798d060044a8a265ff7191384fd363b5be2f474ddf217732dcb4c69f68bf",
      "text": "听到您这么说我更有干劲了！\n下次也请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:799881d3c8e8fd8f775c29c44ab79f9d988ad9af56ef1ae360aa4e8a2e78cc33",
      "text": "我也是，下次也请多关照呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d0f61f2f11ebfff31939a7d4a4b420aaad6d3461bac15af8a87b79e67c71d16",
      "text": "喂——！翔真酱～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e35b2d41df440dd5f4cd49d7693a1cc23d410d0927e2641fcf407808df9d15c0",
      "text": "哎呀，制作人。\n现在要开始拍摄了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56e97a1cadc2e4aa8a895d18d2e725e6d929924e27922c508e1bc865a5996ac4",
      "text": "嗯，现场直播。\n已经忙得不可开交了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ef997f09af9dd037b55d030f047585390bc6dbc31e458ae613e778d259e608b",
      "text": "是偶像的公开演播，\n方便的话翔真酱要不要来看看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37bca3fc0fa50c16f603c5a61b8593244735ff2cb99d9df8a9068ac8a71fc77f",
      "text": "哎，偶像！\n听起来能成为聊天的话题呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f398c8a3745864b76ec5884db8fd58234cf63f3adc5b8a2b6e6b11bc976383f4",
      "text": "那么，我就恭敬不如从命，\n过去打扰一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:987ba07860aa3b428ec26f201eaa1c362650078965ee6576fd32ad3e1eabd711",
      "text": "电视演播厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3853b3e64d784dc6eb672923d907e10094fdee60113b856c1da5a7a3764f63d",
      "text": "（偶像的舞台，\n究竟会是什么样子的呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5373238befc050fa49885556d0877ec3f00038b3e6579e67254f57160e34d248",
      "text": "（……开始了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e",
      "text": "哎……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:284fc43fee3094395b838abb88a1b927fc2ca3c2a3489477614108f151f28f67",
      "text": "（多么……耀眼的光芒啊……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eef91ceaf5a3e3ce7154d393bb4e70557b8798e644fec3b8abbd49b8de94983",
      "text": "（闪烁的舞台，聚光灯。\n我认得这片光芒……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bd055e268ac00742a4be32e7b8c49b0700ec05683362b168d30277a5b776260",
      "text": "（这就是那天，让我为之倾倒的光芒……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_b:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bf515eeb176fcc6a0bb615b161281e2d74eaec3bb2f45e8248d6014dcef6494",
      "text": "我也想，站在那道光芒之中……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_b:cmd-000113:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录制结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_b:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9c3bc189c802be1a41e1218685c58c3edd2f8449ff1add72ae7b22c8790aafd",
      "text": "（呵呵，真伤脑筋啊……产生这种心情，\n还是自学生时代第一次看歌舞伎以来的头一回呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_b:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e8cf1132717a779faac6e6b674324964b04c0c5178c9720492cc1471d242290",
      "text": "辛苦了，翔真酱！\n觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_b:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce6262ccf0a0b00817149abc8524ad5f9c9ff4022c9696d803174edaf3e93dfd",
      "text": "……谢谢你，制作人。\n让我看到了很棒的舞台呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fa2c7d6ceabc7aaccd4f2003be790d9995672e1be21fa9b6ed17cf52d542c3a",
      "text": "……这下可有点不妙了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5f0418ca20cf4c1dd68ed785109af46eff6320470e820ad18293212beb72af7",
      "text": "（明明马上就要录制了，\n那时候的那股躁热却完全退不下去）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd1c59d15096ef6658697e2bba2109ae1e264cd0e351fbb10fbe53a04cfb6216",
      "text": "（明明早就已经不是\n当年为了追梦而离开乡下的年纪了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a630f6959957ba6791c113f585b119bd3e00d2d3f95df71d92d3b4bafaf74dbd",
      "text": "（一旦变成这样，我自己的行动力有多强，\n我自己最清楚不过了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46e4f8c4227c2c93402cf2d0db4e80664d00fd86602c583bcd20e966c44f559b",
      "text": "（到底怎样才能站在那片光芒之中呢……\n脑子里全都在想这个）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50ad3d934078fdd645660539eedfe125338d9cdaaa6fcbc7e905d83c04bf525a",
      "text": "……我果然，还是想成为主角。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fddebc38d508f80beb3dc39bf82d2a5b69bda5cb0f777b5d5e7f54f120e3630",
      "text": "作为主角，站在溢满光芒的\n舞台正中央。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000068:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录制结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:849a9bf080bc4423cc39708247d05759e1b4a2b9dccaca4e6256ebaf7fd9a632",
      "text": "那么，辛苦大家了～。\n下次也拜托大家了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b627087ca3c0e8f29fdf065d6b056fb5444fa4dac5c21b845731dcc860b4352c",
      "text": "辛苦了，华村翔真先生。\n请问您现在有时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0777f586a3250618eb310b14c3d99c0d32d40663c59bd04ed052ec7d2d46a588",
      "text": "哎呀？……这张脸，我是第一次见呢。\n找我有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_c:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:103c3185b638c96f4e281c78e724cf1b21ab6da2969c2d28d7446d2991598815",
      "text": "我是315 Production事务所的人。\n冒昧打扰……请问您想成为偶像吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20c79b3cee9524550415eb73ab0e0d9855194481d18a1c852e1a9b1f189d350e",
      "text": "……呵呵，啊哈哈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:810d45b9363a799c79fa4ff5d2262ce5cb1c4f19ac846d5046f9fdcbe4ff49b6",
      "text": "抱、抱歉！\n突然跟您提这种事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d65cea27408242d37025420c5b3eac9bd3ac966c7e329a3097fee005905636d",
      "text": "对不起，不是那样的。\n只是时机实在太巧了，忍不住就笑了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b21c11e3ba8afa88443e3ffc30367da92e6e31aec2448449da48d26944fc76e6",
      "text": "时机……吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a92a1be827c67a1d9e6cdc8df58c3f96b23edfddc57587dc6854c5e156b6fcd",
      "text": "这只是我个人的事。比起这个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b70dd1486cc046336af1888693b47def0acf3aff65b58550d6862c55ebf97492",
      "text": "提出这个邀请，你知道我是谁吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:333d960be9b602bd006b14a40c215fb8e387b735affca9b9fef3fd26a91e6c6a",
      "text": "是的，当然知道。\n歌舞伎演员，华村翔真先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:782d023afec68760bc9f88636514f4110cbb1b489bf6823eb00b63b18eff15a8",
      "text": "我在您身上看到了偶像的光芒，\n无论如何都忍不住想要向您搭话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccad63e143925355f2e15e88b41cbf89a08dd3fb2257151404d31cea15a376e7",
      "text": "呵呵，偶像的光芒啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19860c5749d92ec805a13a2c2315f3a4df1d29e5f331a42b0e04c4aa22445017",
      "text": "……我会考虑的。\n虽然不知道会不会联络你就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_e:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4791fb11477fe30ba4df1a8faada2b28b2b8855f65e1a06166ed650c671fc94",
      "text": "公园",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd6a8841de0308cea6a2b8a2aabff585586aea46c2d7fa629865b84f63316bbf",
      "text": "噢噢！猫君，来得正好喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b6bb5386f64fe00c3da8a440ee9db8b96abda62b78033c3b950865c7c203ed5",
      "text": "借个旁边坐坐喵！\n嘿咻……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09a54f0d0dc942d85868e6afc54b43830101aafa5bbbb301f1f3436bd1870ca3",
      "text": "喵哈哈……\n暖烘烘的天气真舒服喵～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19c14820e045d078c38b7af7d50f79b5ed4d672fe4745beec3549687a0fe62df",
      "text": "喵～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8397528f4b8eb6b320418f8a3bd00a6928fc79a7e396ab03f7e90738003f1a77",
      "text": "对了对了，之前的新作落语！\n已经在曲艺场表演过了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2549917063533d2507959f21e78732d61ccfea1921b10348cccd30ee6265ae3f",
      "text": "然后你猜怎么着喵……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19c14820e045d078c38b7af7d50f79b5ed4d672fe4745beec3549687a0fe62df",
      "text": "喵～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb58f199b0eb608404173e707acb1d693f61c9ce660f1c914e714ec59e11e6b",
      "text": "当当当当！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1723a4e01ef4d9dd96254c515425cc91b278f644c034d8c7f75e1d462004c530",
      "text": "全场哄堂大笑，大受欢迎，\n简直掌声雷动喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeb79996e2929db6e24e49ebd79dca6c7f31cc7b6a990ace39cb9571f25e16ac",
      "text": "老主顾和观众各位都说，\n很期待下一个新作喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd9fecaffdddcec05ad509b71cf2ec7e160cbab4f3b1ada6b2989e218034d016",
      "text": "好～啦，接下来该献上\n怎样的段子喵～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_f:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a868612a5e8cf56f0e03db7a979faa9b8d9791f11001db2ef9761300187b4a4",
      "text": "嗯～……古典落语固然不错，\n但拿手的宇宙落语也难以割舍……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07207516fa9e8108fd4248a817bd47cdafbab4748f60fb93548e660821837fcd",
      "text": "话虽如此，最近沉迷于写新作\n喵～……哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39260e56bbaa47c9a70392f5147edb945927897a3bd6fdc1cb6081d62ec6ee3e",
      "text": "没错喵！今天就给猫君你，\n表演热乎乎的新作落语喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53ea72e3354dec7296fefc9c62f1800385b25ccace3b278fdd23d1fac6d6fc1e",
      "text": "那么就请听上一段♪\n咚咚锵锵哩个咙咚锵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecfaed31d936ae2e74c59b26f5401efb1d790eb3cab97a4a0d0a62e1b3e21cd1",
      "text": "喵呼呼～♪觉得怎么样喵？\n吾辈的新作落语！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:587e2024ecee3d3314b894167d5752b095b66bfea408652f88acd4801d598d7d",
      "text": "真是太棒太不可思议了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b7e23a49dd37bafbd36e7cf7ccfc9f2837f745bf7e95d93be9721903594989b",
      "text": "喵——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a50e8cdfacb49cd62b241594372947d77431811c90b9cecc4a05787e17aa575",
      "text": "喵呜！？\n想要更新颖的段子喵！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ab269e01d37db898e497d367a144d9c7b8911f93e5d85bb4ce238b4f8ee6bc6",
      "text": "唔唔——……其实吾辈也\n刚好在这么想喵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_f:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00ba83d867fc3c61b3862cbe05ca77f7295411ac9eca26029005d1f2e4085c58",
      "text": "让人眼前一亮的特别段子，\n到底掉在哪里了喵～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0550efe5a09dd75f577e1c94a94a60ac573e6be2462df92543a52e6e2d8a69ff",
      "text": "唔～嗯……难道就没有哔哔哔的灵感\n从天上掉下来喵～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6f3e2ec7e3179566edd309b6051305452c629d49e813dbc7482cca4ac43ed3f",
      "text": "飘飘然～……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85ee1b7594f61c94c8dadafe1442d913547d7c53fa32fe9f9556a50ad817939d",
      "text": "唔……！？好像要收到什么电波了喵……\n动画、豆沙包、商人、偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7f2baafa51674ed24a5037a044a093df96d93afc956a78f6e95696dc5d1dfab",
      "text": "叮——！\n没错喵！偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c1d0120c1ee5311a87e0c9121e3bc1bf66590221093888e3b10900c060486aa",
      "text": "就以偶像为主题\n写新作落语喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d739c8361502259406f5f5b9331018a5e456c36789238b4b322573f95304cc1",
      "text": "既然决定了，\n那就马上开始研究偶像喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c29f31e9572f9185b80b4b162f2fe05d4860135eac4a09e4e16be1da9f621d8f",
      "text": "……喵喵？不过说到偶像，\n至今为止完全没有接触过喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f240cb1fbab771a18c2b2642b47eeb215178f317ea2d4c0ca2a653236b00886",
      "text": "果然，去听听歌或者看现场演唱会\n研究起来更快喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0d13ecb5546866f101a3e4569c9dd11b522f103656ea2e54bd4d059dc3ba343",
      "text": "总之，先去唱片店和书店，\n把偶像的资料统统买回来看看喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd7c253a790e5166e0df72b30f5f1a30f8be5bb9970a6a7412c7fdd070ad1fa",
      "text": "猫君！那么吾辈\n就先走一步喵！喵呼呼～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_h:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3059890eb5c1297304d25b490484c9e5878e3cca1196acbebca66d20fb6b614f",
      "text": "清澄先生，今天非常感谢您的出演！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_h:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a45fefb431d13f6446dd8f7a8e64db4974ebff4dac5245aaef2b05e8e81d6422",
      "text": "哪里。\n感谢您的邀请。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa1b423698f0ffd2a15a1322c39e0b13b21e3c3c33f73dae2842283fa548a609",
      "text": "那位“茶道贵公子”的电视首秀，\n竟然是在我们节目，深感荣幸！下次也请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_h:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54c0ad763aaeb9e5335b22c096a47432016a0af208eaaab2a1d647f03f324003",
      "text": "好的，下次一定。\n那么我先告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d5cbad98335b90ed7e155cfaf9c854f5e1347567c3b1a83ae6cad7851dcf1a8",
      "text": "哈啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3419c4d00442536080f96d580b86ed2ef9727845caaed8bd2db87618d23174d2",
      "text": "（太紧张了，好不容易才应付完录制。\n跟杂志拍摄竟然有如此大的差异）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7872984f60530f20aa8e3b3b42dff20893281a8f394b1a159206fc66eb97a58",
      "text": "（电视出演是瞒着祖父进行的。\n正因如此，本该竭尽全力才对……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c51bb65e7725994f67c00393a43743864ecd164c06ca8aeb891664c98ce85f1d",
      "text": "（但是，绝不能因为这种事就气馁。\n起初总会有不顺利的时候）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80a4878579485c4a3238193fecfac2c33525c27c44770e51d070526b89843c76",
      "text": "（只要下次能够\n表现得更好就行了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f13e3baad2992deb97673a4570badac0f59481da5b71e8a7c990ba5c41fb73f",
      "text": "……没有付出就没有收获。\n我只需贯彻自己的做法即可。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_i:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a368a20109cacbd718ae2ded4a43d7868d359830452ba07fa1d271a40a3ba96",
      "text": "（……话虽如此，\n祖父的事果然还是让人挂心）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d77494654468e5a10b04b5a2dc4c765dca8752c7955b3d7b29f1d90e8ff5046f",
      "text": "（祖父甚至连杂志采访都让我推掉，\n要是知道了这件事，又会勃然大怒吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_i:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31a730a17f1c1c047f5e9d5c1b9a85aa0d74778bc6fbb8cb5656e046c9551b61",
      "text": "（不……无所谓。\n这也是为了将茶道的魅力发扬光大……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_i:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f30de1fbbd14d314cf28d9f224448e942c5ee42ad43d2a965ff200cb75bc8e3d",
      "text": "那个，打扰一下。\n请问现在能耽误您一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c881e5ed913551b54084c6e2575b031476babbe8ce4e176da19d348f4052c0ad",
      "text": "哎……是在叫我吗？\n时间倒是没关系，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c27f6eb214ffbbe269fc713dc531590003a9ab13d72140503f9948b7f1637ad4",
      "text": "我是315 Production这家事务所的\n偶像制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ef1bcaf7673a2b2d1b4aea7dca7e157864511846178703df588d1ef60fafaed",
      "text": "我在杂志上看到了\n茶道家清澄九郎先生的特辑。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e61e390cab9edeebd6b28cc1de92b024fdb6e10e1f9b00c05fe1e8e3a5d6448f",
      "text": "读了文章后，我脑海中浮现出您成为偶像的身影。\n……您想不想试着成为偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abde9755467673c4cd04df46c09462ff338c3740b534b0dea6c94de204002a4b",
      "text": "我、我成为偶像……吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "是的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e09f76f729242f47c3f9782cc3b1e13102b333005e48bb4b2ead88b531a215c0",
      "text": "这……实在不知该如何答复……\n承蒙好意，但我是一心向茶道之人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca89128cc245594ae4288de89899b68881ef60fb3dd2e66ab0d14b4b9a630ca0",
      "text": "突然跟您提这个，实在很抱歉。但是……\n至少能收下我的名片吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_j:cmd-000017:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d256a37270970dd9900f8a4434bab1a998bf1ca70fb4d68dba2e92f1d8db729b",
      "text": "清澄宅邸·九郎的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bef36567d950a404d6c35fbf3588c1ac99b630cded19a9dfb3bee05b6107a153",
      "text": "（315 Production……\n因为有些在意，便顺手查了一下）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:373ea14f79ef2eb18e655cb16d901e913610f61bcba695ece94d534c2363d87e",
      "text": "似乎是新成立的艺人事务所呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f4c67ede7d0e995e889729502a620f8612c4fe942b3d7950c7b18421c0bb60d",
      "text": "（那位人士，到底为什么\n会想发掘我去做偶像呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c068fdc5b92539858639f09053e2e23d2642c3f264b37f6d721e68d7f3c7635",
      "text": "（在节目中同台的偶像们，\n每个人都闪闪发光）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc6ee12d9d8c3bf7e3fd797dff3318b0602fc063b643a10fb1732cd632bb1d30",
      "text": "（对我来说偶像的形象就是那样的，\n毫不夸张地说，是个有些遥远的存在）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be2542862c454877a74b1d198d5069c200b976e980b8c64838c71492368cd8a9",
      "text": "我，成为偶像……\n完全无法想象呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f9588c8c31e7f17d0291b74eee4ace08f6ecb957a7c1ce117c679f6380a2874",
      "text": "（我到底是怎么了。\n不知为何，心潮澎湃）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_j:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f518b3f85ed6c9a6145bb4651180df7553be6cedf25a9cf624164c98fa0d3f57",
      "text": "…………\n哪怕只是听听看，去聊一聊吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_j:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83f7d7f4ebf354d05297d5e5f0331a017686980ec0df603f57ecfa54026d75ef",
      "text": "常言道，萍水相逢亦是宿缘。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_j:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:582874b3c5dea5fb38642bc0bf1eaf867969ac7d02c19d22ba2f3bce41956c7d",
      "text": "虽不知在耀眼的舞台上，是否有我能做到的事，\n但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_j:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8926cfc3dadce2014738122ed267ff6784b0e30c15174542f4002079deec69bc",
      "text": "……也许，我正渴望着\n让这次相遇具有某种意义吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
